| System | Node | Services | Commands |
|--------|------|----------|----------|
| Card System | [[02-card-system]] | CardService, ImageService | `/inspect`, `/disassemble`, `/msearch`, `/kit` |
| Expeditions + Battles | [[05-expeditions]] | ExpeditionService, BattleService | `/mexplore` (start/status/stop) |
| Economy & Crafting | [[06-economy-and-crafting]] | UserService, CraftingService, InventoryService | `/minventory`, `/mcraft`, `/mdaily`, `/mcd` |
| Trading & Auctions | [[07-trading-and-auctions]] | TradeService, AuctionService | `/mtrade`, `/mauction` |
| Hero Progression | [[08-upgrades]] | UpgradeService, MergeService | `/mupgrade`, `/mmerge` |
| Admin Tools | [[03-admin-dashboard]] | Express dashboard, Edge Function | `/mimportcard`, `/mcleanup` |
| Teams | [[01-system-architecture]] | TeamService | `/mteam` |
| Workers | [[09-workers-architecture]] | 6 BullMQ workers | — |
| Drop Cards | — | DropService | `/mdropcard` |
| Mining & Fishing | — | MiningService, FishingService | `/mmine`, `/mfish` |
| Invites | — | InviteService | `/minvite` |
| Notifications | — | NotificationService, UserSettingsService | `/msettings` |

## All commands

| Command | Gate | Description |
|---------|------|-------------|
| `/mping` | — | Roundtrip latency |
| `/mhelp` | — | DM guide |
| `/mkit` | — | Starter kit (5 common cards) |
| `/mstats` | dev | Profile overview with multi-page buttons |
| `/minventory` | dev | Items, materials, equipment |
| `/minspect` | dev | Card detail + image attachment |
| `/msearch` | dev | Search heroes by name/quality/tier |
| `/mupgrade` | — | Queue hero quality upgrade |
| `/mmerge` | — | Merge 2 Excellent heroes for +1★ |
| `/mdisassemble` | — | Salvage hero for coins + essence |
| `/mtrade` | dev | Propose/cancel card trades |
| `/mauction` | dev | Create/bid/cancel/list/info |
| `/mexplore` | — | Start/status/stop expedition |
| `/mteam` | — | Create/delete/rename/add/remove/list/status |
| `/mcraft` | — | List recipes / craft items |
| `/mdaily` | dev | Daily reward claim (+invite bonus) |
| `/mimportcard` | owner | Import card template |
| `/mcleanup` | owner | Purge all user data |
| `npm run db:backup` | — | pg_dump + tar.gz uploads → `backups/<date>_<5-digit-id>.tar.gz` |
| `npm run db:restore <id>` | — | Extracts backup, restores DB + uploads via docker compose exec |
| `/mwiki` | — | Item/region lookup + listings |
| `/minvite` | — | Create invite link, view rewards |
| `/msettings` | — | Toggle notification preferences |
| `/mcd` | — | View all cooldowns & active activities |
| `/mmine` | — | Start mining with team + pickaxe |
| `/mfish` | — | Start fishing with team + rod |
| `/mdropcard` | — | Drop 3 random cards for public grab |
| `/mhelp` | — | DM guide |
| `/mrecipe` | — | View recipe details |

